{"id":"a3-u06","level":"a3","order":6,"title":{"en":"Long reading","fr":"La lecture longue","es":"La lectura extensa","ar":"القراءة المطولة"},"tip":{"en":"With a long text, read twice: first for the main idea, then for the details. Pay attention to what is implied, not only to what is stated, and always ask who is speaking and why.","fr":"Avec un texte long, lisez deux fois : d'abord pour l'idée principale, ensuite pour les détails. Soyez attentif à ce qui est sous-entendu autant qu'à ce qui est dit, et demandez-vous toujours qui parle et pourquoi.","es":"Con un texto largo, lee dos veces: primero para captar la idea principal y después para los detalles. Presta atención a lo implícito y no solo a lo dicho, y pregúntate siempre quién habla y por qué.","ar":"عند قراءة نص طويل اقرأه مرتين: الأولى لتلتقط الفكرة الرئيسية والثانية للتفاصيل. انتبه إلى ما هو ضمني لا إلى ما هو مصرح به فقط، واسأل دائما: من يتكلم ولماذا؟"},"words":48,"lessons":[{"id":"a3-u06-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"passage, paragraph, text","fr":"passage, paragraphe, texte","es":"pasaje, párrafo, texto","ar":"مقطع نصي، فقرة، نص"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u06-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"thesis, main idea, detail","fr":"thèse, idée principale, détail","es":"tesis, idea principal, detalle","ar":"أطروحة، الفكرة الرئيسية، تفصيل"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u06-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"reread, annotate, infer","fr":"relire, annoter, déduire","es":"releer, anotar, deducir","ar":"أعاد القراءة، دون ملاحظات، استنتج"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u06-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"context, background, implicit","fr":"contexte, parcours, implicite","es":"contexto, trasfondo, implícito","ar":"سياق، خلفية، ضمني"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u06-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"bias, source, reliable","fr":"parti pris, source, fiable","es":"sesgo, fuente, fiable","ar":"انحياز، مصدر، موثوق"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u06-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"example, contrast, comparison","fr":"exemple, contraste, comparaison","es":"ejemplo, contraste, comparación","ar":"مثال، تباين، مقارنة"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u06-l7","type":"learn","order":7,"title":{"en":"consequence, sequence, chronology","fr":"conséquence, enchaînement, chronologie","es":"consecuencia, secuencia, cronología","ar":"عاقبة، تسلسل، تسلسل زمني"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u06-l8","type":"learn","order":8,"title":{"en":"emphasis, unfamiliar word, ambiguity","fr":"insistance, mot inconnu, ambiguïté","es":"énfasis, palabra desconocida, ambigüedad","ar":"تشديد، كلمة غريبة، غموض"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u06-l9","type":"learn","order":9,"title":{"en":"conclude, interpret, reading","fr":"conclure, interpréter, lecture","es":"concluir, interpretar, lectura","ar":"خلص، فسر، قراءة"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u06-l10","type":"learn","order":10,"title":{"en":"critical, footnote, quote","fr":"critique, note de bas de page, citer","es":"crítico, nota a pie de página, citar","ar":"نقدي، هامش، استشهد"},"count":9},{"id":"a3-u06-l11","type":"story","order":11,"title":{"en":"Conversation","fr":"Conversation","es":"Conversación","ar":"محادثة"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u06-l12","type":"review","order":12,"title":{"en":"Unit review","fr":"Révision de l'unité","es":"Repaso de la unidad","ar":"مراجعة الوحدة"},"count":9}]}
